  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "無仝"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>顏毓黛</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我是一隻白目ê khàm頭鰻</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無細膩nǹg入去一條烏水溝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iah出一堆pùn-sò</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">掖出滿天ê臭味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">內底ê塗虱叫我恬恬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Phak--leh　mài tín動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水bē-tàng tín動　愈烏愈好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Pùn-sò bē-sái清　愈濟愈好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水若清　pùn-sò若少　臭味若無</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh bih去佗？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬恬仔phak--leh mài出聲、mài tín動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">輕輕鬆鬆過烏天暗地ê日子</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我拍phún、反動、m̄願</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ǹg望衝出chit phiàn烏暗地</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結oang規黨追求--ê是啥人ê利益</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人濟　無代表和諧、團結</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孤身一个　無代表自私、離群</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē-tàng因為我kap lín無仝就</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　欺負--我　抹烏--我　打壓--我　甚至凌治--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā bē因為lín</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　欺負--我　抹烏--我　打壓--我　甚至凌治--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就kap lín sio仝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為我是一个</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　有想法　有看法　有做法　有自我意識ê人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我bē因為無伴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就kap lín徛做伙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">所擺</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lín m̄免認同--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　m̄-koh請lín尊重--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lín m̄免肯定--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　m̄-koh請lín尊重--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lín m̄免包容--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　m̄-koh請lín尊重--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lín m̄免欣賞--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　m̄-koh請lín尊重--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尊重我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　hām lín無仝</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjEqRN8qlF2U9EPL9QVfiXbggt-nNtqhuAxiPMxdDF1sWCo01jM1VIZ4EcmRjOUL06BkO_Q2aMh07wU7Njtln76I5ZLt4U6FlGpKPDNMQen7K1qb8M4CwtrMZvzWpFbS2IVIUX4HDeKeKAQcfPMw9Ymzt4INzTLjayj0L4t61k4dEZIvML3Jp1qakDYWcAE/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_42.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjEqRN8qlF2U9EPL9QVfiXbggt-nNtqhuAxiPMxdDF1sWCo01jM1VIZ4EcmRjOUL06BkO_Q2aMh07wU7Njtln76I5ZLt4U6FlGpKPDNMQen7K1qb8M4CwtrMZvzWpFbS2IVIUX4HDeKeKAQcfPMw9Ymzt4INzTLjayj0L4t61k4dEZIvML3Jp1qakDYWcAE/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_42.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjiTLi_qNB0bLelRZWuk4sm-xCbG9KP8KzNYgH22gthZODcRferGVNeKyT81C9jBJUnvdJy9whmTaD1lO3vTbfU3CEq1VNXqaNsD-hv_bTzFxDn-5GF6XUin8fS0ANtHY59mJoKs3_hAhJOMqLvjAJS4uwQOVWLsjD_6AAZU1eBQNaQ-F3eo9qCj7anBmPS/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_43.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjiTLi_qNB0bLelRZWuk4sm-xCbG9KP8KzNYgH22gthZODcRferGVNeKyT81C9jBJUnvdJy9whmTaD1lO3vTbfU3CEq1VNXqaNsD-hv_bTzFxDn-5GF6XUin8fS0ANtHY59mJoKs3_hAhJOMqLvjAJS4uwQOVWLsjD_6AAZU1eBQNaQ-F3eo9qCj7anBmPS/w454-h640/%E5